<title>MALTA: SOCCER-VALLETTA WIN MALTESE TITLE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-VALLETTA WIN MALTESE TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Valletta City clinched the Malta soccer title for the 15th time on Sunday when they beat bottom club Rabat Ajax 5-2.</p>
</text>
